{"name": "Shelf Heroes", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shelf Heroes</strong>\u00a0is a Roguelite FPS where where your limbs are the loot. Lose an arm mid-fight, grab a better one, keep shooting. Build wild perk combos from modular pieces and blast enemies to plastic bits. Dive into action solo or join forces with <strong>up to 3 friends</strong> in a chaotic <strong>co-op FPS adventure!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WIELD WACKY WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.poster.avif?t=1792490896\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.webm?t=1792490896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.mp4?t=1792490896\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KAPOW! Blast rebellious toys with an arsenal that would make any toy box jealous! A <strong>DIY shotgun</strong>? Locked and Loaded! A <strong>dinosaur-shaped revolver</strong>? You got it! A <strong>frying pan, explosive bow, or a blaster minigun</strong>\u2026 and MORE!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE THE GIANT HOUSE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/0508e95b63eedde5221c8403c19dca8e.poster.avif?t=1792490896\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/0508e95b63eedde5221c8403c19dca8e.webm?t=1792490896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/0508e95b63eedde5221c8403c19dca8e.mp4?t=1792490896\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your own route through <strong>massive open arenas</strong> of the House! Every run brings <strong>new layouts, new challenges, and new secrets</strong> to discover. Watch out for household hazards - that kiddie pool becomes an ocean when you're toy-sized! Return to your Bedroom HQ to unlock upgrades, chat with sock puppet pals, and prep for the next battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SWAP PARTS TO FIT YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/12cbbc2f6090429ec8f3843fe722462c.poster.avif?t=1792490896\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/12cbbc2f6090429ec8f3843fe722462c.webm?t=1792490896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/12cbbc2f6090429ec8f3843fe722462c.mp4?t=1792490896\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each body part\u2014arm, leg, head, and torso\u2014adds <strong>unique perks</strong> to customize your playstyle every run. Combine perks with random power-ups to <strong>discover wild builds</strong> and turn your toy-sized warrior into an unstoppable force!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FACE TOY TERRORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.poster.avif?t=1792490896\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.webm?t=1792490896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.mp4?t=1792490896\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against rampaging toy Sentinels, Zep Knights, Sharkars, the dreaded dino Ravager, and many other deadly toy threats! Push your skills to the limit: dodge, blast, outmaneuver enemies and take down the toughest bosses to take back the House!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Blast rogue toys with wacky weapons in this fast-paced Roguelite FPS! Mix & match toy parts to assemble your Shelf Hero, discover powerful perk combos, and explore a giant House. Play solo or with friends in 3-player co-op!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/7dd5a98a08805998948d87a90553de6f8cd75277/header.jpg?t=1792490896", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Fast-Paced", "Co-op", "Action", "Roguelite", "FPS", "Online Co-Op"], "developers": "Fun Punch Games", "publishers": "Fun Punch Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3151140", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "19 October 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/tggznw9Xt_M", "first_seen": 1792360800.0, "review_rank": 20}